"""
Electronic Silambam - Scoreboard App (Kivy / Android version)
============================================================================
Player A = RED   |   Player B = BLUE

  - Fullscreen, landscape-only (locked via buildozer.spec orientation=landscape)
  - Scoring is LINKED to the timer: touches/penalties only count while the
    round timer is running.
  - Tapping ANYWHERE inside a player's box registers a +1 touch for that
    player and flashes the box in that player's colour. It does NOT pause.
  - Tapping ANYWHERE ELSE on screen (outside the two player boxes) pauses
    the round while it is running, and shows a big centered RESUME popup.
  - Round 1 starts manually (press START). When a round ends, the score
    popup shows, then a short "ROUND N" announcement appears, then the
    next round begins automatically - no need to press START again.
    Same behaviour applies to the round-3 decider.
  - Touch and penalty presses play short beep sounds; the round timer
    running out also plays a distinct sound.
  - 2 rounds normally. If tied after round 2, round 3 (decider) is added.
  - "New Match" resets everything completely.
  - ESP32 boards can send touch signals over WiFi (TCP socket, port 5005) -
    score updates automatically (only while the timer is running), same as
    pressing the on-screen button. Message format: "A:HIT" / "B:PENALTY".
"""

